    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "God as Judge"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "A psalm of Asaph."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The Mighty One, God, the Lord, speaks;",
          "he summons the earth",
          "from the rising of the sun to its setting."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "From Zion, the perfection of beauty,",
          "God appears in radiance. ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Our God is coming; he will not be silent!",
          "Devouring fire precedes him,",
          "and a storm rages around him."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "On high, he summons heaven and earth",
          "in order to judge his people:"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“Gather my faithful ones to me,",
          "those who made a covenant with me by sacrifice.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The heavens proclaim his righteousness,",
          "for God is the Judge."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“Listen, my people, and I will speak;",
          "I will testify against you, Israel.",
          "I am God, your God."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I do not rebuke you for your sacrifices",
          "or for your burnt offerings,",
          "which are continually before me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I will not take a bull from your household",
          "or male goats from your pens,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "for every animal of the forest is mine,",
          "the cattle on a thousand hills."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I know every bird of the mountains,",
          "and the creatures of the field are mine."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "If I were hungry, I would not tell you,",
          "for the world and everything in it is mine."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Do I eat the flesh of bulls",
          "or drink the blood of goats?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Offer a thanksgiving sacrifice to God,",
          "and pay your vows to the Most High."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Call on me in a day of trouble;",
          "I will rescue you, and you will honor me.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "But God says to the wicked:",
          "“What right do you have to recite my statutes",
          "and to take my covenant on your lips?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You hate instruction",
          "and fling my words behind you."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "When you see a thief,",
          "you make friends with him,",
          "and you associate with adulterers."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You unleash your mouth for evil",
          "and harness your tongue for deceit."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You sit, maligning your brother,",
          "slandering your mother’s son."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You have done these things, and I kept silent;",
          "you thought I was just like you.",
          "But I will rebuke you",
          "and lay out the case before you. ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“Understand this, you who forget God,",
          "or I will tear you apart,",
          "and there will be no one to rescue you."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          23
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Whoever offers a thanksgiving sacrifice honors me,",
          "and whoever orders his conduct,",
          "I will show him the salvation of God.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      }
    ]
  },
